Provide a dedicated development database and a command that can restore it. Separate read-only inspection from seed insertion. An agent that prepares a migration should not automatically receive permission to apply it to production. Log changes without exposing secrets.

A safe workflow makes dangerous actions difficult to perform accidentally, rather than relying on the model to remember a warning.','SECURITY','PUBLISHED',TIMESTAMP '2025-11-21 01:00:00',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP FROM sites s WHERE s.code='default' ON CONFLICT (site_id,type,slug) DO UPDATE SET title=EXCLUDED.title,summary=EXCLUDED.summary,content=EXCLUDED.content,group_code=EXCLUDED.group_code,status='PUBLISHED',published_at=EXCLUDED.published_at,updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;

An MCP tool that lists ContentCollections can be safe and useful; a generic tool that runs arbitrary SQL creates a much larger attack surface. Define tools around user intentions and validate inputs at the service boundary. Monitor failures and allow the user to interrupt long operations.

