Mark sensitive tools and require approval before execution. Present the exact target, planned operation and expected effect so the reviewer can make an informed decision. After approval, the service must still enforce permissions and validation; approval does not replace technical safeguards.

This preserves speed for routine work while keeping irreversible decisions under meaningful control.','SECURITY','PUBLISHED',TIMESTAMP '2025-12-11 01:00:00',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP FROM sites s WHERE s.code='default' ON CONFLICT (site_id,type,slug) DO UPDATE SET title=EXCLUDED.title,summary=EXCLUDED.summary,content=EXCLUDED.content,group_code=EXCLUDED.group_code,status='PUBLISHED',published_at=EXCLUDED.published_at,updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;

